调用统计","type":"table"},{"collapsed":false,"gridPos":{"h":1,"w":24,"x":0,"y":5},"id":3,"title":"🔍 AI 诊断与建议 (propose_plan)","type":"row"},{"datasource":{"type":"grafana-clickhouse-datasource","uid":"ch"},"description":"AI 对当前系统状态的诊断结果","fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"color":{"mode":"thresholds"},"mappings":[],"thresholds":{"mode":"absolute","steps":[{"color":"green","value":null}]}},"overrides":[]},"gridPos":{"h":6,"w":12,"x":0,"y":6},"id":4,"options":{"code":{"language":"plaintext","showLineNumbers":false,"showMiniMap":false},"content":"# 🩺 AI 系统诊断\n\n**诊断状态**: ${diagnosis_explained:text}\n\n**诊断代码**: \\`${diagnosis:text}\\`\n\n**诊断时间**: ${time:text}\n\n**分析耗时**: ${duration:text} ms\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ 数据新鲜度\n\n该诊断来自 **最近一次** \\`propose_plan\\` 调用。请查看左侧 \"🚨 数据新鲜度\" 面板确认数据是否过期。\n\n如果数据年龄 \u003e2 小时，该诊断可能已不再准确。","mode":"markdown"},"pluginVersion":"11.3.0","targets":[{"datasource":{"type":"grafana-clickhouse-datasource","uid":"ch"},"format":1,"meta":{"builderOptions":{"fields":[],"limit":100,"mode":"list"}},"queryType":"sql","rawSql":"SELECT\n    formatDateTime(ts_ny, '%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S') as time,\n    duration_ms as duration,\n    JSONExtractString(output_json, 'diagnosis') as diagnosis,\n    CASE JSONExtractString(output_json, 'diagnosis')\n        WHEN 'no_trading_history_due_to_new_system_init' THEN '系统刚初始化，无交易历史数据'\n        WHEN 'normal_operation' THEN '系统运行正常'\n        WHEN 'performance_degradation' THEN '性能下降，需要调整'\n        WHEN 'risk_threshold_breached' THEN '风险阈值突破'\n        ELSE JSONExtractString(output_json, 'diagnosis')\n    END as diagnosis_explained\nFROM llm.ai_brain_calls\nWHERE kind = 'propose_plan'\nORDER BY ts_ny DESC\nLIMIT 1","refId":"A"}],"title":"🩺 系统诊断 (Diagnosis)","type":"text"},{"datasource":{"type":"grafana-clickhouse-datasource","uid":"ch"},"description":"AI 提出的具体改进方案 (从最近的 propose_plan 中提取)","fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"color":{"mode":"thresholds"},"custom":{"align":"left","cellOptions":{"type":"auto"},"inspect":false},"mappings":[],"thresholds":{"mo